==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|wonēn|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*wunaną}}, {{term/t|gem-pro|*wunēną}}, {{term/t|gem-pro|*wunajaną||to love, wish}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*wenə-||to wish, love}}. Compare {{etyl|osx|-}} {{term|wunon|lang=osx}} ({{etyl|nds|-}} {{term|wanen|lang=nds}}) , {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|wonen|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|wunian|lang=ang}} ({{etyl|en|-}} {{term|wone|lang=en}}).

